  "translations": {
    "translations": [
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "KR",
        "iso_639_1": "ko",
        "name": "한국어/조선말",
        "english_name": "Korean",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "담임선생님과 비밀 연애, 그리고 임신. 잠적해버린 선생님을 되찾기 위해 여고생 윤지는 임신중단을 결심한다. 불법 낙태약을 구매하기 위해 윤지는 학교를 떠나고, 경선은 모아둔 돈이 사라진 걸 알고 윤지의 뒤를 쫓는다.",
          "runtime": 106,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "US",
        "iso_639_1": "en",
        "name": "English",
        "english_name": "English",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "High school student Yun-ji harbors a secret romance with her homeroom teacher, which results in a pregnancy. When the teacher abruptly disappears, Yun-ji decides to end the pregnancy. To buy illegal abortion pils, she leaves school early. Meanwhile, Kyung-sun discovers that her savings have vanished and sets out to track her down.",
          "runtime": 106,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "En Route To"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "HK",
        "iso_639_1": "zh",
        "name": "普通话",
        "english_name": "Mandarin",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "女子寄宿學校尋常一天，卻發生不尋常事。已婚男班主任突然失蹤，跟他有秘密戀情的學生忐忑不安，因她懷孕了，而她深信只要拿掉孩子，他就會回來。為了買藥墮胎，她挪用室友的積蓄。那是室友存起來打算出國的旅費，是在校內偷偷賣自製電子煙油的收入。南韓導演柳在寅首部長片，拍出了不一樣的少女孕記，描寫兩個女生踏上一段抹掉傷害和傷悲的成長旅程，當中既有衝突矛盾也有溫柔陪伴，在父親缺席的環境，更突顯女性友誼的堅韌力量。釜山電影節新流獎。",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "在抹去的路上"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "BR",
        "iso_639_1": "pt",
        "name": "Português",
        "english_name": "Portuguese",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Na Coreia do Sul, a estudante Yun-ji engravida após uma relação secreta com seu professor casado. Quando ele desaparece misteriosamente, ela decide interromper a gravidez e roubar as economias da colega de quarto, Kyung-sun, para comprar pílulas abortivas ilegais. Furiosa, a amiga sai à sua procura, mas o conflito acaba dando origem a um vínculo inesperado. Com humor e delicadeza, este delicado filme aborda autonomia corporal, abandono e solidariedade feminina.",
          "runtime": 105,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "A Caminho"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
